# Text files are stored and checked out with LF on every platform, so file hashes (eval provenance) and the
# mutation check's exact-text targets do not depend on the machine's core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
# Binary results and images: never converted
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.duckdb -text
*.parquet -text
*.gz -text
